WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Type II is the bread and butter of residential HVAC. This is what you'll use
every day.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Evacuation removes moisture and non-condensable gases from the system after
repair. Connect the vacuum pump through the manifold gauges. Pull vacuum to 500
